<div class="toggleBox toggleBox--closed" data-selector="toggleBox" id="HelpKSt2025Krzungsbetragnach11AStG"  ><h4 class="toggleBox__head"><span class="toggleBox__headButton" data-selector="_toggleBoxHeadButton" title="aufklappen" role="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="icon"><span class="icon__svg svg-arrow_small--invert"></span></span><span class="toggleBox__title">Kürzungsbetrag nach § 11 <abbr title="Außensteuergesetz">AStG</abbr></span></span></h4><div class="toggleBox__content" data-selector="_toggleBoxContent">
			<p>							
				
<div class="toggleBox toggleBox--closed" data-selector="toggleBox" id="kstzwigKennzahl36442"  ><h5 class="toggleBox__head"><span class="toggleBox__headButton" data-selector="_toggleBoxHeadButton" title="aufklappen" role="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="icon"><span class="icon__svg svg-arrow_small--invert"></span></span><span class="toggleBox__title">Zeile 33</span></span></h5><div class="toggleBox__content" data-selector="_toggleBoxContent">
				<p>Bei der Eintragung berücksichtigen Sie bitte die Begrenzung nach § 11 Absatz 2 Satz 2 <abbr title="Außensteuergesetz">AStG</abbr> (Hinzurechnungskorrekturvolumen).</p>
				




</div></div>
			
			



</div></div>
		
				


</div>
			
				

</div>
			
				
</div>
			</p>

